{% extends "_base.txt.j2" %}
{% set kicker = "CANARY PATH FAILING" %}
{% set headline = "Synthetic Transfer Path Down" %}
{% block body %}
The canary monitoring system detected sustained failures on a production transfer path.
Synthetic transfers are firing, but the expected event chain is not completing within SLO.

  Path:            {{ path }}
  Backend:         {{ backend }}
  Failure rate:    {{ failure_rate }}
  Window:          {{ window }}
  Detected at:     {{ detected_at }}
  Last failure:    {{ last_failure_type }}
  Sample test_id:  {{ sample_test_id }}

Investigate: {{ registry_ui_url }}#/admin/reactors
Runbook:     PRODUCTION_DOCS/06_OPERATIONS/Canary_Transfer_System.md

CLI:
  # Frame A shown; substitute your node's db container + db name
  docker exec agentvault_registry_db_a psql -U postgres -d agentvault_registry_a \
    -c "SELECT * FROM canary_test_results WHERE outcome='failed' ORDER BY fired_at DESC LIMIT 10"

This alert fires when canary path success rate drops below threshold.
{% endblock %}
